| Severity | Count | Top Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🔴 Critical | 0 | — |
| 🟡 Moderate | 6 | Triple Regex.Replace chain in Underscore() (4 allocs/call × millions) |
| ℹ️ Info | 1 | Unsealed class |

